         * |major  | minor  |                |                |                |
         * |version| version|      type      |     seq_no     |   flags        |
         * +----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+
         * |                                                                   |
         * |                            session_id                             |
         * +----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+
         * |                                                                   |
         * |                              length                               |
         * +----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+
